  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u_9b1ff078e11f1b9bcb9b20dd_0",
      "kind": "title",
      "source": "Relation Map",
      "sourceHash": "9b1ff078e11f1b9bcb9b20dd67807caaa1b4899bb4e6f0060d36592aaf5cd4ca",
      "context": "Relation Map",
      "contextHash": "8fc6ec5e1c0eb8cd121b2de052723172c6c97e60fce5cf5af27dc00809f02229",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dd0ce60e24d090ae1049b7b3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Relation map is a type of note which visualizes notes and their __TRILIUM_PH_0__relations__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "dd0ce60e24d090ae1049b7b38be878d4e4c69208e71fa6ff9386f7eab58bd477",
      "context": "Relation Map",
      "contextHash": "8fc6ec5e1c0eb8cd121b2de052723172c6c97e60fce5cf5af27dc00809f02229",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_27591f4e86746d469eb2d832_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "27591f4e86746d469eb2d8323f6dda382149928ec0550ca8a5a6fdfc24cab9a6",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_17601bb64da95ed028119fc8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a new note and add it to the map, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Add note__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button at the bottom of the map, then click anywhere on the map to place it there.",
      "sourceHash": "17601bb64da95ed028119fc85a3de9ffa001af693b17297c054c93496c7b0503",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_64a2e387e51dcaf39275cc0a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "While the map waits for the click, a translucent box follows the mouse to show where the note will go. To cancel, press the button again (now labeled __TRILIUM_PH_0__Cancel__TRILIUM_PH_1__) or press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Esc__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "64a2e387e51dcaf39275cc0a452f5cde3affc36971f95868c315382b7678ee68",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4aa22c9dc9f228fab0fcc9a4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The note is created as a child of the map, with the default title of a new note. It opens in the note panel (see below) with its title selected, so you can type its name straight away.",
      "sourceHash": "4aa22c9dc9f228fab0fcc9a480df1f6f43250b6220d643c87ded064018ef1f56",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0aa8bf3a622bcd0338e4c387_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "An existing note can also be dragged from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__. It will be placed at the position it's dragged on.",
      "sourceHash": "0aa8bf3a622bcd0338e4c3876d871bdc7ada4a70efd5bca0f285413b8c44c1f8",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d5412243e79e6423b6732039_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Multiple notes can also be dragged via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Multiple selection__TRILIUM_PH_1__. The notes will be positioned near the dragged position without overlapping.",
      "sourceHash": "d5412243e79e6423b6732039d57c100749aeeb944f95ff4d532b06e65b136385",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7eebb76f9ea7a494201ea4b9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The dragged note can be a sub-child of the map, or it can be at any arbitrary position.",
      "sourceHash": "7eebb76f9ea7a494201ea4b93ea627408e6eaccbda66a58ba6c2a3c736222ba1",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_62582eb0a37cddec6d364891_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Notes can also be pasted onto the map. Copy or cut them in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, then click the map and press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__V__TRILIUM_PH_5__, or right click an empty part of the map and select __TRILIUM_PH_6__Paste note(s)__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "62582eb0a37cddec6d3648917da73f8d5efa49194a44fc733ad6589a016217b3",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e413001ee2e73c969387f813_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "With __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__V__TRILIUM_PH_3__, the notes are placed under the mouse, or in the middle of the map if the mouse is not over it. From the right click menu, they are placed where the menu was opened.",
      "sourceHash": "e413001ee2e73c969387f813df09cc36aec32a5b55f36a0078eb6e8b4231ff9a",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5f172bb87b0a99e509cf42a9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Copied notes stay where they are in the tree. Cut notes are moved under the map, as if they had been pasted into it in the tree.",
      "sourceHash": "5f172bb87b0a99e509cf42a9e1cc1ea9405f071f8932e1c3a5152addd10b4c29",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d5fb6aa4bb79b9ea09b5e3b2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Links to notes, such as an __TRILIUM_PH_0__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_1__ copied from a text note, can be pasted the same way. If the clipboard holds no link to a note, the notes last copied or cut in the tree are pasted.",
      "sourceHash": "d5fb6aa4bb79b9ea09b5e3b23d2c874be4deea9bc566271eb0b3a3b8ddfa548c",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7ec6171085abe6a629b18c69_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The right click menu of an empty part of the map also has __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add note__TRILIUM_PH_1__, which creates a new note where the menu was opened.",
      "sourceHash": "7ec6171085abe6a629b18c69d64566779b9eda343fdeb67b263975ab06867b6b",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eda0451b19a4c5b04d656e8e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a relationship, hold the mouse on the dot on the right of a note and then:",
      "sourceHash": "eda0451b19a4c5b04d656e8e2a62e4cebb4f73b2677ec64ca12004bc0ddfef6d",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ffdb78697c3f7d835f4ffeaa_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Drag it over another note to create a relationship pointing from the first note to the second one.",
      "sourceHash": "ffdb78697c3f7d835f4ffeaa028914eb9964290482235ccdf7b84da3101a2486",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_271bb496a7b7540b7810a6c1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Drag over the same note to create a self-referencing relationship (represented as a loop).",
      "sourceHash": "271bb496a7b7540b7810a6c10af696ed99cdb2d507467ed4e7574584cb3f0132",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6d7e90af2d1947f73d355f7d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Once dragged, a popover next to the relationship asks for its name. Type a new name and press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__, or pick a relation name already in use from the suggestions. To cancel, press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Esc__TRILIUM_PH_3__, close the popover or click elsewhere on the map.",
      "sourceHash": "6d7e90af2d1947f73d355f7da643ecba731dad9b79ba0eb20b084cd9df2f050a",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8d88f68ac4690fae8c5dc85f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each note is shown as a card with its icon and title, colored in the note's color the same way as the cards of a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Kanban Board__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "8d88f68ac4690fae8c5dc85f83a00e0d6a0fec7a4607a4be1081584885c4190a",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f53f4294be5546579afea16a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Hovering a note highlights its relationships, in the note's color if it has one, and fades the other relationships.",
      "sourceHash": "f53f4294be5546579afea16a7d6ba309931e1b158a4ba98fd836767cde8080cb",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b3bf965ab98e7ac536d8375c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To view or edit a note, click it on the map. This opens the note panel (see below).",
      "sourceHash": "b3bf965ab98e7ac536d8375c76ce6bb8fc9b69b93a9112fd65e7b6fa9eeed1a8",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0ea6b362c0e9e1f9c1079b9b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To open the note in a new tab instead, __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+click it or click it with the middle mouse button. __TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__+click opens it in a new window. The right click menu offers the same options.",
      "sourceHash": "0ea6b362c0e9e1f9c1079b9bb9a745a807172bdcd8a81e928739f174e0d11cff",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d78e85fffd22e04e3fa7dec0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To edit the title of a note, change its color or delete it (either from the map, or delete it completely), right click the note.",
      "sourceHash": "d78e85fffd22e04e3fa7dec0af649b9e24974a233aab6af05903f279c51c68a8",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e97e04bd92e7b13b354276e0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To rename or delete a relationship, right click it and select the corresponding option.",
      "sourceHash": "e97e04bd92e7b13b354276e08ad85efde02586ffd5ac658329d2fd857236cae6",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bac4b8f20e96123ab6cd6b77_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On a __TRILIUM_PH_0__read-only__TRILIUM_PH_1__ map, notes cannot be moved and relationships cannot be drawn, renamed or deleted. The right click menu of a note only offers to open it, and a relationship has no right click menu.",
      "sourceHash": "bac4b8f20e96123ab6cd6b779a3d500fcf063cfdb0827f18844fff0a01d1609d",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_36e3708bdc81288216ddbadd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To move around the map, drag an empty part of it, and zoom with the mouse wheel or the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ buttons at the bottom-right corner. Clicking the zoom percentage goes back to 100%, and __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Fit to view__TRILIUM_PH_4__ zooms and pans so that all the notes are visible.",
      "sourceHash": "36e3708bdc81288216ddbadd471afde299f0c618086c8dac31957a065acc2d6b",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9578c22a3c1eabe9751a4840_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Once the map has been clicked, the arrow keys or __TRILIUM_PH_0__W__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__A__TRILIUM_PH_3__ __TRILIUM_PH_4__S__TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__D__TRILIUM_PH_7__ pan it, and __TRILIUM_PH_8__+__TRILIUM_PH_9__ and __TRILIUM_PH_10__-__TRILIUM_PH_11__ zoom it. The __TRILIUM_PH_12__?__TRILIUM_PH_13__ button at the top-right corner of the map lists all its keyboard shortcuts.",
      "sourceHash": "9578c22a3c1eabe9751a48405c781a7d30c680547c5611cc786907dafd12ff51",
      "context": "Relation Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "05ba6db0376992f395434f89f729af51d19ef8d00a56bdcb06cf6a81589607f5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_63dde44e8e38c8122a546f33_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Note panel__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "63dde44e8e38c8122a546f338f80a97d2d5b3c460fd48d7838ce4a4caa58e318",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_75ddb2ad7df2ce14c7cbc77b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When a note on the map is clicked, a panel opens to the right of the map and the note is highlighted. If the panel would cover the note, or the note is partly off-screen, the map pans to bring it into view. The panel contains:",
      "sourceHash": "75ddb2ad7df2ce14c7cbc77b3214d9a37c8fee49f4d39820aa111f98b5d3acf6",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_54f6a80b2dc192736b888ab3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The title and icon of the note, both editable.",
      "sourceHash": "54f6a80b2dc192736b888ab36a31901afbc40e3bc317d263dbbce6efcaf90f38",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_975d44ef5628060452e836f7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button to expand the panel over the whole map, and to restore it afterwards.",
      "sourceHash": "975d44ef5628060452e836f7ac4bb1aa96b381e3b0763d9270f43ba5427ec028",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ad53e9081d7607ea3bee1521_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Buttons to interact with the note:",
      "sourceHash": "ad53e9081d7607ea3bee1521094130ff335aa28df2331c5cbf60da881d1b82b3",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd42b393a67f07667ab1ab5b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ Open the note in the current tab, or, through the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ menu, in a new tab, split, window or the quick edit popup.",
      "sourceHash": "cd42b393a67f07667ab1ab5bfb720faf2b16bceebcf82b59cf49baf23121b9b9",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0928305ba433a162f5790065_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ color picker to change the color of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "0928305ba433a162f57900654b9083b5ae929be62167eeeb0bd250fd3fa21c14",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0443aef12e0e6c975fccf93a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button to remove the note from the map, which can optionally delete the note as well.",
      "sourceHash": "0443aef12e0e6c975fccf93aef82ebb51ed925357c5cf52cad224b795beafd67",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7ab95cdbd0925f97332ce511_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of the note, if any.",
      "sourceHash": "7ab95cdbd0925f97332ce511d7a2bd37e4ce400a476b958bc8bd23c021da5392",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6958d92779f398003786eb03_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The note's content, which can be edited directly from the panel.",
      "sourceHash": "6958d92779f398003786eb031218e195d36870d05cd4393d79f9d221d0db6a30",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a3ce728b5081af30f04b7d0d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The color picker and the remove button are not shown if the map is read-only.",
      "sourceHash": "a3ce728b5081af30f04b7d0d3a395cfc74fe6b91d28e5b7525c5981738b62a7c",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5171ac10b09950ce1ad3c6e3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Clicking another note on the map switches the panel to it. Similarly, clicking an __TRILIUM_PH_0__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_1__ inside the panel switches the panel to that note, as long as it is on the map.",
      "sourceHash": "5171ac10b09950ce1ad3c6e32ef1b9f469ef2472a13e74781559b35830c6f654",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_edab3317c6a99900b03a6435_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To close the panel, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button at its top-right, click an empty part of the map, or press __TRILIUM_PH_1__Esc__TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "edab3317c6a99900b03a64359e9e85131d77c9576678f518734685a7af05ccaa",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_88c0a1b399d185928c91c89b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On mobile, the note opens as a dialog over the whole screen instead of a panel.",
      "sourceHash": "88c0a1b399d185928c91c89b66ae06ddb3c4b3a8a35305d46af784b7fc1f2e79",
      "context": "Relation Map > Note panel",
      "contextHash": "1cf0b76abfde3780cfcb7058d17a89982127fcd4972bfe3c7dc32a9c59e9dbd9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f07617e620460a3b0d9f98e3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Development process demo__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "f07617e620460a3b0d9f98e3d7cdbc26f54a4771a752bf930eac7f57e62f1c3e",
      "context": "Relation Map > Development process demo",
      "contextHash": "3599e7e2d66ee19a7c469336b51e119c319820fda6519bee77e44a95fbd0f733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1b1df1053d14f830a5967131_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is a basic example how you can create simple diagram using relation maps:",
      "sourceHash": "1b1df1053d14f830a59671310a97ccb52a10d57a1f2bd602a26694a2a84bbd8b",
      "context": "Relation Map > Development process demo",
      "contextHash": "3599e7e2d66ee19a7c469336b51e119c319820fda6519bee77e44a95fbd0f733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dd0d48d78e4dd959002c9643_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "And this is how you can create it:",
      "sourceHash": "dd0d48d78e4dd959002c9643dac5051660d1815c03a4b2de384a214404e5ae03",
      "context": "Relation Map > Development process demo",
      "contextHash": "3599e7e2d66ee19a7c469336b51e119c319820fda6519bee77e44a95fbd0f733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6c2475fd3c3d44decc32a2f9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "We start completely from scratch by first creating new note called \"Development process\" and changing its type to \"Relation map\". After that we create new notes one by one and place them by clicking into the map. We also drag __TRILIUM_PH_0__relations__TRILIUM_PH_1__between notes and name them. That's all!",
      "sourceHash": "6c2475fd3c3d44decc32a2f918b9d8b0646cbef10a51195de1a973545c4b9e23",
      "context": "Relation Map > Development process demo",
      "contextHash": "3599e7e2d66ee19a7c469336b51e119c319820fda6519bee77e44a95fbd0f733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fadcb7245519bcee6715a412_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Items on the map - \"Specification\", \"Development\", \"Testing\" and \"Demo\" are actually notes which have been created under \"Development process\" note - you can click on them and write some content. Connections between notes are called \"__TRILIUM_PH_0__relations__TRILIUM_PH_1__\".",
      "sourceHash": "fadcb7245519bcee6715a412ee4ebcda99a82850cdf57a50ada836c780cf7d1f",
      "context": "Relation Map > Development process demo",
      "contextHash": "3599e7e2d66ee19a7c469336b51e119c319820fda6519bee77e44a95fbd0f733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a3f0185559f184ac1ca31d23_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Family demo__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "a3f0185559f184ac1ca31d238a0c771849c6331740eccfb519f4a8c4f9e53e8c",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9a061ab913db7d7d328b216a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is more complicated demo using some advanced concepts. Resulting diagram is here:",
      "sourceHash": "9a061ab913db7d7d328b216a70b7164292f969c2546d25e5f857e0dcd0bfdd67",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_64f8dcab4e10be7608a551f2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is how you get to it:",
      "sourceHash": "64f8dcab4e10be7608a551f2905acbded55cfdd1ee4a4dfd0fd42e906b87f71f",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_563d7485ab2383dd7d604b96_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are several steps here:",
      "sourceHash": "563d7485ab2383dd7d604b96ed33d0b5203ae52540b0ae5b15d1da49d455b601",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_98c293e65197242af1bf83cd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "we start with empty relation map and two existing notes representing Prince Philip and Queen Elizabeth II. These two notes already have __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__relations__TRILIUM_PH_2__defined.",
      "sourceHash": "98c293e65197242af1bf83cd5f693fa5e00530d5fd8bbdcd2b86403bb68b7db0",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_04781ae12adc4719c866f418_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "There are actually two \"inverse\" relations (one from Philip to Elizabeth and one from Elizabeth to Philip)",
      "sourceHash": "04781ae12adc4719c866f418967e58cb2a560f608e8c59cf2606ce0c3e7541b4",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e143ea7f0427cf7e0e13683_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "we drag both notes to relation map and place to suitable position. Notice how the existing __TRILIUM_PH_0__ relations are displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "4e143ea7f0427cf7e0e136839c19c00c4cef87fd39f6af001ccb4c75d28baf09",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cb7026b22a876df99b84fb09_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "now we create new note - we name it \"Prince Charles\" and place it on the relation map by clicking on the desired position. The note is by default created under the relation map note (visible in the note tree on the left).",
      "sourceHash": "cb7026b22a876df99b84fb09f1d96c014f4c688601b4233dafc3e91dfa650940",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ea7f709d456d4cacf576d999_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "we create two new relations __TRILIUM_PH_0__ targeting both Philip and Elizabeth",
      "sourceHash": "ea7f709d456d4cacf576d999aa8df0a16d79d40adc539532c346b83978b6ac35",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_606b2bb958e1a59416ed0ae5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "now there's something unexpected - we can also see the relation to display another __TRILIUM_PH_0__ relation. This is because there's a __TRILIUM_PH_1__relation definition__TRILIUM_PH_2__ which puts __TRILIUM_PH_3__ as an \"__TRILIUM_PH_4__inverse__TRILIUM_PH_5__\" relation of __TRILIUM_PH_6__ (and vice versa) and thus it is created automatically.",
      "sourceHash": "606b2bb958e1a59416ed0ae529ebc895c0c1cfdec74187c6b3a750ed9cfec5ee",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5f5665a34febed96a8841387_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "we create another note for Princess Diana and create __TRILIUM_PH_0__ relation from Charles. Again notice how the relation has arrows both ways - this is because __TRILIUM_PH_1__ definition specifies its inverse relation as again \"isPartnerOf\" so the opposite relation is created automatically.",
      "sourceHash": "5f5665a34febed96a88413876c9169c7a81498d73ab8f68dedc89ba49fd59b73",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2471953abdf4b8d730076a8d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "as the last step we pan & zoom the map to fit better to window dimensions.",
      "sourceHash": "2471953abdf4b8d730076a8dc94c6dbfab2ef9278036677af8e45c8ee79006b9",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_688099ed56fd46ef4f9800f5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Relation definitions mentioned above come from \"Person template\" note which is assigned to any child of \"My Family Tree\" relation note. You can play with the whole thing in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__demo notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "688099ed56fd46ef4f9800f55320e19a3c86368e4e82d4c6555d28c82a92a6d9",
      "context": "Relation Map > Family demo",
      "contextHash": "02cf1edf9f59dfd8670245d830f37516eb641886dc7154e88dfd9087fbddcfbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3a6d1fb2aad0730f8fbf6243_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Details__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "3a6d1fb2aad0730f8fbf6243f61c299c0babcc4689608302304ba903518ae115",
      "context": "Relation Map > Details",
      "contextHash": "4ab9fc2017d90ea1219586c644af44cdbce09d359184f125773baaa11eef47bd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0109eaf10479822d92ba26c0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can specify which relations should be displayed with comma delimited names of relations in __TRILIUM_PH_0__ label.",
      "sourceHash": "0109eaf10479822d92ba26c0ced4c62c07c24cfdfefbddc686bff004aab4c592",
      "context": "Relation Map > Details",
      "contextHash": "4ab9fc2017d90ea1219586c644af44cdbce09d359184f125773baaa11eef47bd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cb76a1347d7f91d26ebbd58f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Alternatively, you can specify comma delimited list of relation names in __TRILIUM_PH_0__ which will display all relations, except for the ones defined in the label.",
      "sourceHash": "cb76a1347d7f91d26ebbd58f034c00ab38a5d7d319ad8eae1fb65e428419bc9c",
      "context": "Relation Map > Details",
      "contextHash": "4ab9fc2017d90ea1219586c644af44cdbce09d359184f125773baaa11eef47bd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b056715d5493280169407022_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "See also__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "b056715d549328016940702234a644413c07c0558c4f59edcc3d85ec15afe208",
      "context": "Relation Map > See also",
      "contextHash": "26fe0dc1bcfb550f13ff09b5d0213a8ef4f451c65f3287692372c58fcf9461b7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ad17df8a63be8e4acbfceae3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Map__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is a similar concept.",
      "sourceHash": "ad17df8a63be8e4acbfceae3475d6c821a50fc378d6e982c5571312b3710feb4",
